// Verus program: second-largest (a.k.a. "rolling max" as specified)
// The postcondition matches the problem statement exactly.
//
// Intuition:
// - If |s| < 2 => None
// - Else compute the maximum value `m`, and then compute the maximum among
//   elements strictly less than `m` (call it `second`).
// - If all elements equal to `m`, there is no distinct second-largest; we
